d Output</h2>\\n          <span class=\\\"text-[10px] font-mono px-2 py-1 bg-black text-white\\\">CONFIDENCE: 98.4%</span>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"flex-1 border-t-2 border-black py-6\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"font-serif text-2xl leading-relaxed text-[#333] max-h-full overflow-hidden italic\\\">\\n            The architecture of the page is not merely a container for information but a map of intent. Within these margins, we find the residue of thought captured in glyphs. Extracting the essence requires a systematic deconstruction of the visual field into semantic units.\\n            <br><br>\\n            Each character bears the weight of its context. When we pull text from a page, we are translating static ink back into the fluid stream of data.\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"mt-6 flex gap-4\\\">\\n          <button class=\\\"flex-1 h-12 border-2 border-black flex items-center justify-center uppercase font-bold text-xs tracking-widest hover:bg-black hover:text-white\\\">Copy to Clipboard</button>\\n          <button class=\\\"flex-1 h-12 bg-black text-white flex items-center justify-center uppercase font-bold text-xs tracking-widest\\\">Export .JSON</button>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n  </main>\\n\\n  <!-- Footer Status Bar -->\\n  <footer class=\\\"h-12 border-t-2 border-black bg-black text-white px-10 flex items-center justify-between font-mono text-[10px] tracking-widest\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-6\\\">\\n      <span>STATUS: IDLE</span>\\n      <span>CHARS: 412</span>\\n      <span>LANG: EN-US</span>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-6\\\">\\n      <span class=\\\"opacity-50\\\">LATENCY: 42MS</span>\\n      <span class=\\\"opacity-50\\\">ENGINE: NEURAL_LITE_04</span>\\n      <div class=\\\"flex gap-1\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"w-2 h-2 bg-green-500 rounded-full\\\"></div>\\n        <span>SYS_OK</span>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n  </footer>\\n</div>\\n                    </body>\\n                  </html>\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_END]"
